OL,3,GNEWSA'My confidence has grown due to
OL,4,Aguide dog Isha'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who lost his vision in both eyes
OL,7,Fhas credited his guide dog with
OL,8,Fchanging his life, calling her his
OL,9,F"best furry friend".
OL,11,FLee Roberts, 46, from Barnsley,
OL,12,Fcontracted a bacterial infection in
OL,13,F2020 which turned to sepsis, causing
OL,14,Fsight loss "literally overnight", he
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FAfter a three-year wait he was matched
OL,18,Fwith labradoodle Isha, with Lee
OL,19,Fcrediting their partnership for
OL,20,Fenabling him to join classes and learn
OL,21,Fnew skills including ballroom dancing
OL,22,Fand the martial art jiu-jitsu.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
