OL,3,GNEWSA'My confidence has grown due to
OL,4,Aguide dog Isha'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's life changing - the independence
OL,7,Fand how my confidence has grown working
OL,8,Fwith Isha, you just can't explain it,
OL,9,Fit's unbelievable," Lee said.
